#: ../../../news.rst:2298
msgid ""
"If you set the :setting:`TWISTED_REACTOR` setting to a :ref:`non-asyncio "
"value <disable-asyncio>` at the :ref:`spider level <spider-settings>`, you "
"may now need to set the :setting:`FORCE_CRAWLER_PROCESS` setting to ``True`` "
"when running Scrapy via :ref:`its command-line tool <topics-commands-"
"crawlerprocess>` to avoid a reactor mismatch exception. (:gh:`6845`)"
